# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day 12

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| affordable | 가격이 알맞은 | The product is affordable. |
| convenient | 편리한 | Online shopping is convenient. |
| reliable | 신뢰할 수 있는 | We need a reliable supplier. |
| improve | 개선하다 | We need to improve our service. |
